---
description: Restore Creed products page to the original layout when the user asks to revert
alwaysApply: true
---

If the user asks to revert products, restore the original state, or go back to the old products page, copy these backups over the live files:

- `backups/products-original.html` → `products.html`
- `backups/styles-original.css` → `styles.css`

That restores the pre-Division-card products page (old cards + yellow featured tiles). Do not keep the Division portrait-card trial after that restore.
